{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/d50dc5e62b61d4af0b096fe9143aa668.avif?t=1763125341\" width=86 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/54f774bc8eae978185aa97ebef3dabe2.avif?t=1763125341\" width=500 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shadow Island: Part I</strong> tells the first half of a two-part, story-driven adventure that blends point-and-click exploration with branching choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After surviving a shipwreck, you awaken on a mysterious island and set out to find your missing companion, Beatrice. As time passes, you will face dangers that stir in the dark, <strong>encounter alluring women</strong>, and uncover the first layers of the island\u2019s hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every feature, scene, and relationship you see here is part of <strong>Part I.</strong> The choices you make, and the bonds you form with the people you meet, will shape your path and carry into <strong>Part II</strong>, where the mystery of <strong>Shadow Island</strong> will reach its conclusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Will you hold on to your purpose, or lose yourself before the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/f555e4aa820691d085a92ee470911daf.poster.avif?t=1763125341\" width=642 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/f555e4aa820691d085a92ee470911daf.webm?t=1763125341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/f555e4aa820691d085a92ee470911daf.mp4?t=1763125341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/8fc5afe7281870d50749adcf72e659f2.poster.avif?t=1763125341\" width=642 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/8fc5afe7281870d50749adcf72e659f2.webm?t=1763125341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/8fc5afe7281870d50749adcf72e659f2.mp4?t=1763125341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/54a2668c350684bc453bad8d5d95068a.avif?t=1763125341\" width=500 height=253 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/6c0ca6e64d95b72ea21da515bef5e39c.avif?t=1763125341\" width=100 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Arabelle</strong><br>A redhead surrounded by mystery and rumor. She offers help when asked, but always at a price. Arabelle moves between ally and enigma, leaving you unsure where her true loyalties lie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/ec95a9b137c1cf0d6f419de532132778.avif?t=1763125341\" width=100 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lady Hale</strong><br>The dominant force in town. A tall and busty woman, Lady Hale rules with cold discipline and little patience for weakness. Her authority is unquestioned, maintained through both fear and cunning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/2109cdf67a56d0185e3236d3541d7b87.avif?t=1763125341\" width=100 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Charlotte</strong><br>The daughter of Lady Hale. Sheltered all her life, she behaves like a spoiled princess who expects the world to bend to her. Still, glimpses of a softer, kinder side occasionally break through her facade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/7b5e8f9a101bec1fd9e3e5982567c6af.avif?t=1763125341\" width=100 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lily</strong><br>A woman of Indian origin, gentle and caring. Always by the protagonist\u2019s side, she shows a sincere devotion that goes far beyond the role of a servant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989890/extras/5593782905c2216957ce082dfb05ae29.avif?t=1763125341\" width=100 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\